WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Navigation runs automatically.
Navigation and satellite matching run automatically.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
See what the aircraft sees.
Onboard imagery supports automatic satellite matching.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.800
Optional review: inspect a match if needed.
The pointer opens a comparison on the right. Matching runs automatically.

00:15.800 --> 00:21.600
Optional comparison: review camera and satellite.
Recorded imagery and diagnostic links support optional visual inspection.

00:21.600 --> 00:26.500
Blend images for optional review.
The pointer selects Overlay and adjusts camera opacity.

00:26.500 --> 00:30.700
Inspect the original frame if needed.
An optional view of the captured camera image and satellite crop.

00:30.700 --> 00:35.000
Automatic matching continues.
The comparison closes. Normal operation needs no comparison window.
